#### **2. Template Engagement Tracking**
```javascript
// In templates.js routes
router.put('/:uid/favorites/:templateId', async (req, res) => {
    // ... existing user update logic
    
    // NEW: Increment template favorite count
    await Template.findByIdAndUpdate(templateId, {
        $inc: { favorites: 1 }
    });
});

router.delete('/:uid/favorites/:templateId', async (req, res) => {
    // ... existing user update logic
    
    // NEW: Decrement template favorite count
    await Template.findByIdAndUpdate(templateId, {
        $inc: { favorites: -1 }
    });
});
```

#### **3. Cross-Device Sync Implementation**
```java
// In TemplateRepository.java
public void syncUserStateOnLogin(String uid) {
    // Fetch user's likes/favorites from server
    apiService.getUserLikes(uid).enqueue(new Callback<UserLikesResponse>() {
        @Override
        public void onResponse(Call<UserLikesResponse> call, Response<UserLikesResponse> response) {
            if (response.isSuccessful()) {
                // Update local Room database with server state
                updateLocalUserState(response.body());
                // Refresh UI to show updated state
                refreshTemplateStates();
            }
        }
    });
}
```

